        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>口腔特殊检查</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n        color: #4a4a4a;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .document {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 600px;\n        padding: 40px 20px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .title {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 28px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n        font-size: 22px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .sub-section-title {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    p {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"title\">口腔特殊检查</div>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">（抽取其中一项并记录检查结果）</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"section-title\">1、牙髓活力测试</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"sub-section-title\">热测</div>\n    <p>①医嘱：您好，我现在为您进行牙髓活力测试热测，可能感到热或痛，如有不适，请举左手示意。</p>\n    <p>②器械选择：热牙胶棒、酒精灯、打火机、凡士林</p>\n    <p>(1) 首先，隔湿患牙及对照牙；</p>\n    <p>(2) 顺序：先测对照牙（首选患牙的同颌同名牙，其次为患牙的对颌对侧同名牙）再测可疑牙，低于 10 度为冷刺激，高于 60 度为热刺激。</p>\n    <p>(3) 老师请帮忙点燃酒精灯，谢谢你老师。</p>\n    <p>(4) 在牙面均匀涂布一层凡士林，加热牙胶棒。置于对照牙唇颊面中 1/3 处。询问患者有无不适。然后再将牙胶棒置于患牙唇颊面中 1/3 处，询问患者有无不适。</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"sub-section-title\">冷测</div>\n    <p>器械选择：小冰棒或氯乙烷</p>\n    <p>①选用小冰棒，将小冰棒置于掌心，稍加捂化，挤出冰头，置于患者对照牙唇颊面中 1/3，再测患牙。</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
